# The corpus is LINK-ONLY (see data/provenance.md): Colbert 1945 is AMNH copyright, released for
# personal / educational use with no redistribution grant. Scans are never committed; use
# scripts/get_data.sh.
data/raw/
data/index/

data/interim/*
# ...except our Stage-3 reader output for the three PUBLIC-DOMAIN volumes. These are our own
# transcriptions, they let anyone rebuild the index without a GPU, and on their own they still clear
# the corpus floor (740 pages / 179,616 words vs the required 300 / 60,000).
!data/interim/ocr/
data/interim/ocr/*
!data/interim/ocr/lucas_1901.md
!data/interim/ocr/gilmore_1914.md
!data/interim/ocr/leidy_1853.md
# data/interim/ocr/colbert_1945.md is deliberately withheld — redistributing a full transcription of
# a copyrighted volume is the same act as redistributing the scan.
